              }
            },
            {
              "id": "535717ed-c3e8-485a-bc2a-54869bdc9f23",
              "text": "成员关系",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "ba64d06b-2f01-4d24-8da8-66b5f94ed918",
                  "text": "[陈述] Membership",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "535717ed-c3e8-485a-bc2a-54869bdc9f23",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\noutParam (Type u) → Type v → Type (max u v)\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe typeclass behind the notation `a ∈ s : Prop` where `a : α`, `s : γ`.\nBecause `α` is an `outParam`, the \"container type\" `γ` determines the type\nof the elements of the container.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "8b84cd75-e29a-4483-817e-949220beb403",
                  "text": "[陈述] Membership.mem",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
