                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : outParam (Type u)} → {γ : Type v} → [self : Membership α γ] → γ → α → Prop\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe membership relation `a ∈ s : Prop` where `a : α`, `s : γ`.",
