                  "text": "[证明] Membership.mk",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "535717ed-c3e8-485a-bc2a-54869bdc9f23",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : outParam (Type u)} → {γ : Type v} → (γ → α → Prop) → Membership α γ\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
