              "parentId": "064c6d95-ffb9-4d0c-beec-52d4d259b549",
              "data": {
                "note": "**概念** 成员关系（Membership）\n\n**锚点** 3 个\n\n**概念依赖（聚焦内）**\n- 内部管道（equation compiler / recursor / match）：type 3 / proof 1",
                "tags": [
