                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "12b31a95-abcf-43a3-b583-cb83ced2bdd6",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 实例\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → Membership (Set α) (Filter α)\n```\n\n**文档**\nIf `F` is a filter on `α`, and `U` a subset of `α` then we can write `U ∈ F` as on paper.\n\n**说明** 类型类实例，解释实现，不是学习先修；默认折叠。",
